   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thanks, Owen, you're verified. I can see one of your two beef phos ($15.00) is missing from order Q-7601. You can choose how to be compensated:\n\n1. **Refund to your Visa ending 4242:** $12.00. That's the $15.00 pho minus its $3.00 share of your WELCOME10 promo discount. The $3.00 promo share is added to your account as credit.\n2. **Account credit only:** $18.00, which is the pho's price plus 20%, for use on a future order.\n\nWhich would you prefer?"
